    "reference_text_sha256": "c0c409932c86aa88c535f49332d4c388bbadd0de4a23d9b9b8eb75454af5f754",
    "retrospective_focus": "Day 8 is gemcitabine alone. If your team omits this dose for low counts, it is skipped for this cycle. Ask for your next blood-test date before leaving."
